# Tells GitHub how to count languages for the repo's language bar (it changes nothing else).
# The rendered website and the Quarto extensions are not our source code:
docs/** linguist-generated
site_libs/** linguist-vendored
_extensions/** linguist-vendored
_freeze/** linguist-generated
*.scss linguist-vendored
*.tex linguist-generated
# The book is written in Quarto (.qmd) files with R code; count them as R:
*.qmd linguist-language=R linguist-detectable
*.R linguist-detectable
